<title>CHINA: Shanghai Shangling changes managers.</title>
<headline>Shanghai Shangling changes managers.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shanghai Shangling Electric Appliances Co Ltd has chosen Chen Junmin as general manager following the resignation of the former manager Ge Wenbin, a company official said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Chen Junmin was previously a manager with the Shanghai Light Industry Holding Group, the official said.</p>
<p>Ge Wenbin has become deputy general manager of the Shangling Group, the main shareholder of Shanghai Shangling, the official added.</p>
</text>
